Z||000005||FieroGTGirl||06-20-2000||03:00 AM||||Bam Bam~  <P>Click on edit/delete message.  Then highlight the sentence that will start with [img] and ends with [/img].  This will be the "smiley code".  After sentence is highlighted right click on the highlighted text and select "copy".  You then need to open either notepad, wordpad or even microsoft word.  Once open right click on blank page and select "paste".  Now just save this document somewhere you can find it easily.  When you want to use a "smiley", open this document highlight the appropriate text, right click on the text, select "copy", then on your post right click, select paste.  AND there ya go!!!!! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/lickout.gif">  <P>Have Fun!!!! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P> ||||reg||2
